lingmo-filemanager (5.0.2+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * widgets/weather: show system theme icon for weather conditions (WMO
    code mapped to 31 icon names); hand-drawn fallback kept when icon
    loading fails.
  * widgets/weather: add shared in-memory cache (15 min TTL, LRU max 10
    cities) so multiple WeatherWidgets share a single network request.
  * widgets/nowplaying: download HTTP/HTTPS album-art URLs to
    ~/.cache/lingmo-filemanager/album-art/ and load via ImageView; local
    file:// URLs continue to load directly as before.
  * widgets/widget: animate size changes with a 200 ms OutCubic transition
    instead of an instant geometry update.
  * widgets/widgetlayer: animate widget addition (scale 0.8→1, opacity
    0→1, 300 ms OutCubic) and removal (scale 1→0.8, opacity 1→0, 200 ms
    OutCubic); widget is destroyed only after the exit animation finishes.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0800

